<title>USA: Reynolds Metals Co Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Reynolds Metals Co Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		    $0.13   profit	 $1.15</p>
<p> Net profit		  1,000   profit	84,000</p>
<p> Revs		    1,749,000		1,872,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   63,970		   63,593</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $0.82   profit	 $5.35</p>
<p> Net profit		 89,000   profit     389,000</p>
<p> Revs		    7,016,000		7,252,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   63,730		   63,050</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 net includes $0.14/shr gain on LIFO inventory liquidation and $0.08/shr loss on disposition of assets.</p>
<p>Year 1996 net includes $0.29/shr gain on LIFO inventory liquidation.</p>
<p>Year 1996 net includes $0.60/shr restructuring and accounting charge.</p>
<p>Year 1995 net includes $0.24/shr accounting charge.</p>
<p>The share is after deducting preferred dividends.</p>
</text>
